    /begin CHARACTERISTIC ECE_CC08_tiSyncPhaseDlyInit_C "F2366: initial CG208 phase delay between ASICs - the last channel has to have the highest delay sync period if sync changes are used - these values have to fit to ECE_CC08_tiSyncInit_C (here: TimerE resolution!) (no SERAP)"
